  "required_parent_scene_hooks": [
    "Preload distinct whole leaf and call build_whole_art(self) after the actual scene children have entered, before parent native binding pins; retain actual returned object identity. The old entrance leaf/UID/manifests remain unchanged.",
    "Hide only existing scenic placeholder MeshInstance children under HelperDoorWest, HelperDoorEast and CompactSideThrone before parent pins those nodes; retain their actual anchor nodes, positions and all actor/contact/floor resources. The new leaf creates its own painted visual meshes at the same authored ground origins and never edits placeholders itself.",
    "Include literal-empty art.binding_error() in parent presentation/capture/restore preflight and actual actor admission guards. Validate retained node identity too; the leaf has no authority to infer parent readiness.",
    "Drive set_presentation from actual room/once-history/exit state at transitions, after actual restore commit and before framing/admission. Expected room0/1/2/3/4 labels map to curtain/formation/approach/king1/king2, with exterior after court clear. Helpers remain gathered after birth even if interrupted/defeated; retries derive the once-state from the parent snapshot.",
    "Use complete landmark_world_corners for inspecting relevant scenery. Quiet side wings may be scenically cropped; whole14x44 floor and every distant court cannot be compulsory fit inputs to the close following camera. Actual actors, body sweeps, full cues, contacts and reachable landings must keep their existing complete native framing proof.",
    "Contact Cue remains independent. Exterior available/open cloth is only presentation, so never substitutes for real Area/monitoring/completion predicates."
  ],
